# /clear, /new and /reset: each hands the screen to scrollback and starts a
# fresh conversation. A prompt with an answer, then /clear; a second prompt,
# then /new; then /reset on the fresh screen it left. `snapfull` keeps the
# history above the screen, which is where the handed-off rows went.
gateway reset-turns.json
wait 2
title launch
type first question alpha
key Enter
wait 3
snap turn1
title turn1
type /clear
wait 0.5
key Enter
wait 2
snap clear
snapfull clear
title clear
type second question beta
key Enter
wait 3
snap turn2
type /new
wait 0.5
key Enter
wait 2
snap new
snapfull new
title new
type /reset
wait 0.5
key Enter
wait 2
snap reset
snapfull reset
type third question gamma
key Enter
wait 3
snap turn3
snapfull turn3
